OMNeT++ Experiment 27
Title: Mini Project: Performance Evaluation of a Cellular Network

Description:
Evaluates cellular throughput, delay, packet delivery and handover count under a small configurable network scenario.

Project source files:
- Experiment_27.ned  (NED network and simple module)
- Experiment_27.cc   (C++ simulation module)
- omnetpp.ini           (simulation configuration)

Run in an installed OMNeT++ project:
  opp_makemake
  make
  ./Experiment27Network -u Cmdenv -f omnetpp.ini

NOTE: Graph and console images in this folder are prepared demonstration artifacts.
Run this project in OMNeT++ to obtain environment-specific simulation logs and vectors.
